Package: lumo-installer
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: calamares, kpmcore, os-prober, cryptsetup, pkexec, lumo-theme
Description: Lumo OS system installer (Calamares configuration and branding)
 Complete Calamares installer setup for Lumo OS: UEFI+BIOS aware
 partitioning defaults, squashfs-based system copy (unpackfs), user and
 hostname creation, locale/keyboard setup, GRUB installation and a
 finalize hook that purges the installer and live infrastructure from the
 installed system. Fully branded with Lumo OS identity and slideshow.
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
